  {
   "text": "and *nobody* is calling you back,",
   "start": 2.15,
   "times": [
    2.15,
    2.93,
    3.28,
    3.4,
    3.68,
    3.8
   ],
   "end": 4.41
  },
  {
   "text": "it's not the *job market,*",
   "start": 4.43,
   "times": [
    4.43,
    4.68,
    4.91,
    5.01,
    5.24
   ],
   "end": 5.9
  },
  {
   "text": "it's your *resume.*",
   "start": 5.92,
   "times": [
    5.92,
    6.25,
    6.54
   ],
   "end": 7.39
  },
  {
   "text": "So the fix *number 1*",
   "start": 7.41,
   "times": [
    7.41,
    7.54,
    7.63,
    7.99,
    8.31
   ],
   "end": 8.52
  },
  {
   "text": "is use the *right word.*",
   "start": 8.54,
   "times": [
    8.54,
    9.09,
    9.43,
    9.52,
    9.94
   ],
   "end": 10.44
  },
  {
   "text": "And in order to do that,",
   "start": 10.46,
   "times": [
    10.46,
    10.86,
    10.99,
    11.22,
    11.31,
    11.51
   ],
   "end": 11.78
  },
  {
   "text": "you have to pick out the *skill.*",
   "start": 11.8,
   "times": [
    11.8,
    11.91,
    12.19,
    12.32,
    12.54,
    12.72,
    12.81
   ],
   "end": 13.62
  },
  {
   "text": "If they use the word *data analysis*",
   "start": 13.64,
   "times": [
    13.64,
    13.79,
    13.94,
    14.26,
    14.35,
    14.63,
    14.86
   ],
   "end": 15.63
  },
  {
   "text": "and in your resume you, you write",
   "start": 15.65,
   "times": [
    15.65,
    15.97,
    16.11,
    16.3,
    16.68,
    17.27,
    18.12
   ],
   "end": 18.96
  },
  {
   "text": "*good with numbers,*",
   "start": 18.98,
   "times": [
    18.98,
    19.16,
    19.33
   ],
   "end": 20.06
  },
  {
   "text": "then your resume is *rejected.*",
   "start": 20.08,
   "times": [
    20.08,
    20.4,
    20.59,
    20.89,
    21.09
   ],
   "end": 21.75
  },
  {
   "text": "And the fix *number 2*",
   "start": 21.77,
   "times": [
    21.77,
    22.08,
    22.14,
    22.44,
    22.69
   ],
   "end": 22.89
  },
  {
